WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.425
Cells are far too small to see without a microscope.

2
00:00:04.253 --> 00:00:07.753
A person is made of about thirty seven trillion cells.

3
00:00:09.999 --> 00:00:13.374
One cell is about a fiftieth of a millimetre across.

4
00:00:14.499 --> 00:00:18.474
Your eye can't see anything smaller than a tenth of a millimetre.
